 the problem. I'll try to get a fix in next week.\r\n\r\nNote to self: The loading thread is blocked on TimestampAdjuster.sharedInitializeOrWait() because the first HlsMediaChunk loaded is not a master timestamp source. In 2.16.1 on the other hand, the first chunk loaded is a master timestamp source. I need to check if a load re-ordering has happened between 2.16.1 and 2.17.1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1079326847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1079373559","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065#issuecomment-1079373559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065","id":1079373559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAT2ozs5AVe73","user":{"login":"tpuserhp","id":16076051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc2MDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16076051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp","html_url":"https://github.com/tpuserhp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-25T19:35:39Z","updated_at":"2022-03-25T19:35:39Z","body":"Thanks for the issue investigation and the update!!!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1079373559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tpuserhp","id":16076051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc2MDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16076051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp","html_url":"https://github.com/tpuserhp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1080946460","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065#issuecomment-1080946460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065","id":1080946460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAT2ozs5Abe8c","user":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-28T17:31:57Z","updated_at":"2022-03-28T17:34:13Z","body":"The symptom seems to be related with **HLS chunkless preparation** which is enabled by default in the 2.17 release. To quickly fix the problem in 2.17, you may instantiate the player with an HLS media source that has chunkless preparation disabled:\r\n\r\n```java\r\nHlsMediaSource.Factory factory = \r\n  new HlsMediaSource.Factory(dataSourceFactory).setAllowChunklessPreparation(false);\r\nExoPlayer player =  \r\n  new ExoPlayer.Builder(context).setMediaSourceFactory(factory).build();\r\n```\r\n\r\nI still need to check if there is a bug in chunkless preparation or this playlist is incompatible with the feature. I'll update this issue accordingly. \r\n\r\nInformation on chunkless preparation on this [blog post](https://medium.com/google-exoplayer/faster-hls-preparation-f6611aa15ea6).\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1080946460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1081032104","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065#issuecomment-1081032104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065","id":1081032104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAT2ozs5Abz2o","user":{"login":"tpuserhp","id":16076051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc2MDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16076051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp","html_url":"https://github.com/tpuserhp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-28T19:08:10Z","updated_at":"2022-03-28T19:08:10Z","body":"Thank you support for providing the quick fix which works very  well .  My app is now running release 2.17 with no problem from that playlist.  Much appreciated!!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1081032104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tpuserhp","id":16076051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc2MDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16076051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp","html_url":"https://github.com/tpuserhp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tpuserhp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1084411721","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065#issuecomment-1084411721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10065","id":1084411721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAT2ozs5Aos9J","user":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-31T10:49:04Z","updated_at":"2022-03-31T10:49:04Z","body":"Root-causing the issue: the player fails to load/prepare the playlist in chunkless mode because the playlist contains the CODECS attribute but it is missing the audio codec. The player assumes the video variants are prepared but the audio one is not, and the player gets stuck.\r\n\r\nIf you have access to the encoding/packaging process, I'd suggest you update how the playlist is created and add the audio codec to CODECS. Then try with chunkless preparation, you might see some improvements in start-up time. \r\n\r\nOn the ExoPlayer side, we submitted a fix to detect this case and fall back to traditional preparation. The fix will be available on the next ExoPlayer release.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/1084411721/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":6342795474,"node_id":"CE_lADOAT2ozs5FnDutzwAAAAF6D2DS","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/6342795474","actor":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54315740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christosts","html_url":"https://github.com/christosts","followers_url":"https://api